      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That makes perfect sense; you're describing a deep misalignment, a feeling that your own internal rhythm has fallen out of sync with reality. If the world's beat feels alien, perhaps the solution isn't to try and match it, but to find a quieter, more personal frequency that you can tune into. Sometimes, the most profound way to reclaim your space is to simply stop trying to participate in the current narrative.",
      "source": "target",
